## Detection reports.
## The timestamped names are the tool defaults, written next to the
## executable; the fixed names are what the scan_*.cmd scripts ask for,
## written into the repository root. Case-insensitive so a report is never
## tracked just because -report was given a differently-cased name.
UTS_Report_*.txt
Chardet_Report_*.txt
[Uu][Tt][Ss]_[Rr]eport.txt
[Cc]hardet_[Rr]eport.txt

