*.nupkg
*.snupkg
packages/
!packages/build/

## Misc
*.swp
*~
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

## Audit run outputs.
## Every file under audit/runs and audit/reports is generated by audit.py and
## its tools; the evidence is reproducible from the corpora and the harness, and
## a single run is several megabytes of CSV. Regenerate with audit/run-all.sh.
audit/runs/
audit/reports/

## Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
